<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Take the name of Jesus ever,</l><l>As a shield from every snare.</l><l>If temptations round you gather,</l><l>Breathe that holy name in prayer.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, the precious name of Jesus,</l><l>How it thrills our souls with joy;</l><l>All the favor of the Father</l><l>In this name we may enjoy.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>At the name of Jesus bowing,</l><l>Falling prostrate at His feet,</l><l>Claim His vict’ry over evil</l><l>And the enemy defeat.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
